<title>UK: EIB sets 200 million rand three-year fixed/FRN.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 200 million rand three-year fixed/FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fixed/floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Caboto Holdings SIM.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN RAND  COUPON    *15.956    MATURITY    15.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE   FIXED/FRN     ISS PRICE  99.9985   PAY DATE    15.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST PERIOD THEN THREE MONTH ZAR BANKERS</p>
<p>		ACCEPTANCES RATE LESS 60 BP THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05 BP   SELL CONC  0.05 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED UNDER ISSUERS DEBT ISSSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		SENIOR AND UNSECURED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
